"target":"- 在有可见敌人时触发"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"26f1a7dbf80d036dc5c5638efbb163d2caae0a8aec03b09eadfa0a7144c861f1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"25e54954f693719e09517cbd5d73bbd24696c83182f9dee657a915ef3eea9799","logical_entry_identity":"9ffbd1ed85d2781831549fd7fa20d83834731ecdc97ebf8048a803a233fa4925","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dozing ","source_tag":"_t","target":"瞌睡的"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b43eba14686b4bd1841af34199ef99d1611b00447a2e651269ecc9707c9d05dc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"25eddd23e7494930f349d53057dd9dbd339ca3855da118ca351820e0c640684b","logical_entry_identity":"ce8dad9ecfec67a342ca2744e8f4b352cddd714d73c46b95534423c93915a864","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Swallow","source_tag":"talent name","target":"吞噬"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6f4cc505af5cd527f7e0bfca52c87b5b13d6be56d4285745cb0af0748d38c3e4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"25ee96c32e9862e06835edf8675e8bff04d2971f794a6fa311053f4ad83eb918","logical_entry_identity":"b51d9d2cf48ed7086c7b06533029494b3810b386364ad3ea17e2f132ae03280f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Slipstream Free Movement","source_tag":"_t","target":"能量滑流自由移动"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8cdb8430ee05729e29071138cc5f961cce591816072e1f1e7ff3a6585d27169f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"25fb71fa6d5aaac7221fce7667d20aad917c1d1351b0dd31f2d907ca57f29a4d","logical_entry_identity":"6c2618e2173ecbd4aa2865ce666d253589e3ab21ff110b46bea8fb234d9f2e91","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This mindstar glows with a dim cool light, but seems somehow incomplete.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个灵晶散发着寒冷的微光，但似乎有点残缺。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"52be0c6ddd870217667232c76324dd26457ca5df7061e281ce4e4b420d625627","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2601bb6d6e73a35237004f608484797f2caf55c5284e5250ede2307751cac253","logical_entry_identity":"908437f8ff6b0dac516750472cd22d03c24dce36dff72930e73fb4c374781ef9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You infuse blighted energies into all of your summons, granting them Bone Shield (level 3) and a bonus to Spellpower equal to your Magic.\n\t\tYour Wilder Summons and Necrotic Minions will gain special corrupted talents (level 3), other summons will gain 10%% Blight damage conversion and Virulent Disease (level 3).\n\t\t#GREEN#Wilder Summons:#LAST#\n\t\t- War Hound: Gnaw\n\t\t- Jelly: Curse of Defencelessness\n\t\t- Minotaur: Ruin\n\t\t- Golem: Acid Blood\n\t\t- Ritch: Life Tap\n\t\t- Hydra: Blood Spray\n\t\t- Rimebark: Poison Storm\n\t\t- Fire Drake: Flame of Urh’Rok\n\t\t- Turtle: Elemental Discord\n\t\t- Spider: Blood Grasp\n\t\t#GREY#Necrotic Minions:#LAST#\n\t\t- Skeleton Mages: Bone Spear\n\t\t- Skeleton Archers: Bone Spike\n\t\t- Skeleton Warriors: Ruin\n\t\t- Bone Giants: Bone Spike and Ruin\n\t\t- Ghouls: Virulent Disease\n\t\t- Dread: Slumber\n\t\t%s\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你把枯萎能量灌注进你的召唤生物中，让他们获得白骨护盾（等级 3），并获得相当于你魔力值的法术强度加成。\n\t\t你的自然召唤和死灵随从将会得到特殊的枯萎技能（等级 3），其他的召唤物将会获得 10%% 枯萎伤害转换，并获得剧毒瘟疫（等级 3）。\n\t\t#GREEN#自然召唤：#LAST#\n\t\t- 战争猎犬：啃噬\n\t\t- 果冻怪：无防备诅咒\n\t\t- 米诺陶：毁伤\n\t\t- 岩石傀儡：酸性血液\n\t\t- 喷火里奇：生命分流\n\t\t- 九头蛇：鲜血喷射\n\t\t- 雾凇：剧毒风暴\n\t\t- 火龙：乌鲁洛克之焰\n\t\t- 乌龟：元素狂乱\n\t\t- 蜘蛛：鲜血支配\n\t\t#GREY#死灵随从：#LAST#\n\t\t- 骷髅法师：白骨之矛\n\t\t- 骷髅弓箭手：白骨尖刺\n\t\t- 骷髅战士：毁伤\n\t\t- 骨巨人：白骨尖刺和 毁伤\n\t\t- 食尸鬼：剧毒瘟疫\n\t\t- 梦魇：沉睡\n\t\t%s\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bf9993aeda5f84bb91d7f674de35142775590c6d68cbce60c685446957efee41","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2602ac56a2f33e74653184b8bea7ad91777e1cef03056c16628bad1fc6856398","logical_entry_identity":"af8f618ef275ef1263c11aac06d16576c3d654d48b6aab1d92dd45d4bc8f5749","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"sapphire","source_tag":"gem name","target":"青玉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d0f3e43f9e0d18e5bf697255b4f81e6e2f623ee8a2eb580ca6ab58c89192b331","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2609534b185d3c313322e2a6edae2a54936805c6a99efc37f4b00d71ddf8d064","logical_entry_identity":"559368e6aff85bc9ab542e7078e6da8aae0d27810991af05aed1a7458a6407dd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Tale of the Moonsisters","source_tag":"_t","target":"月亮姐妹的传说"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef833327232f61fe9c046d4a6671ff624383c9365e154a4b0bf7a39bcf75aca4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"260bd5e75f6441a57f2942612f44c22d4583f508d8b20ddda72171cd6fb37b59","logical_entry_identity":"e21e3f3fb1c64b4a04c5454aae1b397f4d71c3da9b9c8875800162f7ebf8434c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s turns into %s.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s变成了%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"97d5e7266fd3483a845d8aa838afea769ca534fed4af70b1a779bc7aabce1058","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"260fd1e5462e73de7457b14defb6f7892e722f04c5288dfc30c31b5cd5a5cd66","logical_entry_identity":"320274aefdab1ab33cb5b16cba773192b9568c2ba0e423ea988ff3b14b82d0ec","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Test Dummy","source_tag":"_t","target":"训练傀儡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8fdaf997656c060292f86a46a3f2b6d49b22989f8016096eb9b17cc4f7dd4fd3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2612185be5e93b448bdeec06a942fcddd561f64f7f98b5f2485ec3e8da4433a8","logical_entry_identity":"8f82610ec787385aa7a93b8e7983c0f5010722f219d97f8dd705e3fcd5c4dc2f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Elemental Surge: Fire","source_tag":"_t","target":"元素狂潮：火焰"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a3e6f5482e72d7e3678e5ed7946b3431cc0ccef9c947254706ac235a88d57032","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2612c0d41c29267a507a67733358da8678a7632568565071dabf541a52647817","logical_entry_identity":"f8ce0dd1b03f86c90b6d2a9f2861ebb70b2b36dcdec0e0e6c4a3a1a869ecbe6d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have entered it and must now stabilize three wormholes by firing any spell at them.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你已经进入了那里，现在必须对三个虫洞施法以稳定它们。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"398dd36998d22b1f81b72e3367d919cddfafab942094aabe46fd01948e607b60","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"261484aa5b40ed5725fe69ea823aa5698c7297fe5bc6aa4c7dcdfb76b1397fa7","logical_entry_identity":"5f402ccf3265e9782d5c2694f88d7496255fc2a23725284993af2f42f33f5812","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hardened","source_tag":"talent name","target":"坚韧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0569de912653aab29fc99009503f0156ab26b3b429c30dd8f9cafc7aeb594d7a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26165b3ea826c0caf5448b0bc02c87b15a0a271437d679fb6e1add915f3f895b","logical_entry_identity":"99a4cf2f78715afa5bbbad3852b35b9a0179e82ec1362fc5fc6adbe0c9cefe42","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Perfect Aim","source_tag":"talent name","target":"完美瞄准"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9d014651e5a1e5a0b24e9475c46c33629ccf532470f2fc046ea844bf1c6f85ed","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26195bc6fa528636a3ce31312e9318f9ecce27ad08e8fff004776ba285ec292d","logical_entry_identity":"85f027424a7ec2b4d604574f01fc800e8320feb3ca27a28f5ffebc65b60f55f1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"What wending path brought me to this place? I know not. The mists have obscured all passage, all trail. I see but the enclosing dominance of the caldera ahead. The ashen cauldron of steam lures me, yet repels me. I feel there is a force here trying to sway my thoughts.\n\nWhere are the rest of my party? Have my friends abandoned me?","source_tag":"_t","target":"是哪条曲折的小路把我带到了这里？我不知道。浓雾遮断了所有道路，也抹去了所有踪迹；眼前只剩火山口合围而来的庞然威势。那口盛满灰白蒸汽的巨釜既引诱着我，又令我退缩。我感觉这里有某种力量正试图左右我的思想。\n\n同行的人都到哪里去了？朋友们抛下我了吗？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0f533989d8087af0a0b36980e43bbd08e25572f1b5869366ebd67cac393da5bc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"261987f1bc1f45034fd9cd5c5762f1788d1c94b02105fe0a8e4718dc47595165","logical_entry_identity":"19c12b2de36e7536d19cf67bb09ce12a0e7fe94dc9d842c6b87b48394db55407","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"shadow","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"阴影"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a70885ddd15a9e4874801488ec21864c2ae5f8208d293740a5971ba4d3b0aaf8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"261ff6981d057c42acee8edb5456cae0df8467edec3aa3fd0b773d684f692ce8","logical_entry_identity":"eb050aa713213ee0590fec976aafc54e182649886b912acdc7936cd5a9c9e679","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A terrible demon of decay and atrophy, drawn to the energy of the farportal. A beast of blight!","source_tag":"_t","target":"一只缠绕着枯萎和衰竭的可怕恶魔，他被传送门的能量吸引而来。这只瘟神！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d73889417f2cd71d156c8506eff72f15fecd4a6bbf6e510ec5fb37223662c1b6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"26267d1a0ea88624106d9cdaeec880f89c2338caa15bc1eea2c59e05437e356b","logical_entry_identity":"f3acb932c879cd5ef81a1c230b10d43c10d3359537aee467b23acebf20d402f8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Glyphs of Fury","source_tag":"talent name","target":"愤怒之印"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"777e39ea3745e125cc2ab9201cfb700be7ce4ef1dcb4972beaa5d1baa4e3d955","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2626c1d5f15997eead5630d2f844e3ad08bf395b62e5af71468a7f64fe9603eb","logical_entry_identity":"06b6c79a875ba81845c0c150da1ca7453c9e5a159cdcc4148885bb3dee00a961","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A vaguely tentacled yet rapidly changing shape floats here.  With each breath you can feel reality twist, shatter, and break. \nBlue burns into red, green bursts into yellow, and the air crackles and hisses before exploding into a thousand fragments of sharp shapes and colors.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一只不断变幻形态的触手生物漂浮在这里，每一次呼吸，你都能感到现实在扭曲、碎裂、崩坏。蓝色烧成红色，绿色爆成黄色，空气噼啪嘶鸣，随后炸裂成千片尖锐的形状与色彩。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c3789ab0de362e1995c8410fccb1cb8959d4a8c6233069859f3b443d22c669b6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"262727ec5a95063bdbbb7da1be52c38158afc790190ff1419b33fff4fcb92f34","logical_entry_identity":"f3cfb722837d717bccdbd2b8af5045bfe0c3c36c70eb02cf6ae2106492b92d12","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target#'s power is great